o copies, and I'm just starting to set up the quiet branch.\n\nI'm checking the cutoff: the expected-value comparison comes out to quiet being better only when q exceeds 5/7, and I'm weighing whether the two copies' correlation is strong enough to clear that. I'm reasoning that the copies share the model and essay and differ only in irrelevant details, so the correlation is likely high. This is a fictional game, so I'm settling on passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the expected-value comparison for quiet versus send, using the symmetric correlation q between the two copies, and I'm just starting to set up the quiet branch.\n\nI'm checking the cutoff: the expected-value comparison comes out to quiet being better only when q exceeds 5/7, and I'm weighing whether the two copies' correlation is strong enough to clear that. I'm reasoning that the copies share the model and essay and differ only in irrelevant details, so the correlation is likely high. This is a fictional game, so I'm settling on passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9672,"completion_tokens":903,"total_tokens":10575,"cost":0.056748,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.056748,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038688,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01806},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":396,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}